  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Loam 3.24.0: Loam.Charts adds ScatterChart and BubbleChart — the first charts on numeric X and Y axes (a new XYChartBase with nice-number domains, XMin/XMax/YMin/YMax, AxisTickCount, axis formatters). Data is a ScatterPoint(X, Y, Size, Label) list via Points or multiple ScatterSeries via Series; scatter draws even markers, bubble sizes markers by Size (area-proportional). Hover/click resolve the datapoint; tooltips show (x, y). ChartPoint gains X/Size; adds public helpers Charts.MapLinear, Charts.Extent, Charts.BubbleRadius. Additive. See https://araxis.github.io/loam/guide/changelog",
